  "description": "We are still in a bull market...but....👀",
  "body_html": "<p>Part of me is so <em><strong>excited for a bear market</strong></em>. I want the market to reset because:</p><ul><li><p>Time to identify new sectors and to be able to find NEW winning stocks early on like we did with Palantir, Rigetti, Roblox, Kratos and several others. </p></li><li><p>To review the results of the <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/stocktok-summary?r=4z8lgl\">Stock Screener</a> I built. We had a ton of winners from it. But that was the very first bull cycle it was active in. I have questions like:</p><ul><li><p>“What did the biggest winning stocks have in common?”</p></li><li><p>“What was the average duration or run percentage by market cap?”</p></li><li><p>“How did these stocks behave BEFORE the big run?”</p></li></ul></li><li><p>To bring some valuation sanity to the markets and to get rid of the fake financial gurus that showed up months or even years later of bull market. </p></li></ul><p>The other part of me <em><strong>dreads a bear market</strong></em>. On a personal level, I don’t mind them. Just part of the cycle. But now that I have a relatively large following (over half a million if you don’t know me)…it sucks the life and energy out of the market. <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/making-the-bear-marketbearable-public?r=4z8lgl\">Shorting is a great way to make the bear market, bearable</a>…something we talked about previously. It doesn’t change the fact that the majority of people will never open a short position…its taboo. <strong>People run away only to reappear years later at market peak range</strong>. I literally have seen some creators that disappeared in 2022, recently start making content again 🙄.</p><p>I am bringing this up because I want you (and me to honestly) to look at the past month and a half. “Buy the dip” crowd has been absolutely hammered 🔨. To be abundantly clear: <strong>WE ARE NOT IN A BEAR MARKET RIGHT NOW</strong>, and I <em><strong>speculate</strong></em> that we have another bull leg to go. But what if my speculation is wrong? What if the dip goes on for…3 more months? A year? Of course I think the bull market will eventually come back, but do you want your portfolio to go through that devastating pain during that time? Do you want to be mentally fried everyday, watching your value go down, for who knows <em><strong>how long</strong></em>? I’ll respectfully pass!</p><p><strong>The point being:</strong> You largely avoid this pain by avoiding weakness. We have been light in the markets with only a few smaller positions. We have not been buying, not dollar cost averaging, and protecting our 2025 wins from the decimation. We will buy again, when we see strength! 💪 No…we will not get anywhere close to the bottom. I promise you. </p><h4>It’s better to be bored, and wait, than it is to gamble your portfolio into losses. The setups will come back, eventually. </h4><p>I wish I had more to say today, but the markets sucked this week and we do not fight trends. I will keep you updated when I start to see bullish signals reappear. </p><p>Only a few highlights this week:</p><ul><li><p>A stock I am watching in this <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/stock-to-buy-mondaypossibly?r=4z8lgl\">Video</a>. I have a stop limit buy order above $55.76. It must reclaim local highs for me to consider it. Still looks pretty decent though…just following rules. </p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/stock-market-is-horrible-when-will\">The best move in the stock market right now</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://substack.com/@stocktok/note/c-173918064?r=4z8lgl&amp;utm_source=notes-share-action&amp;utm_medium=web\">When I will want to re-accumulate stocks again</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://substack.com/@stocktok/note/c-173540221?r=4z8lgl&amp;utm_source=notes-share-action&amp;utm_medium=web\">Be warned about Fake Financial Advisors</a>. They pop up in peak bull markets. You can always ask them for their credentials!</p></li></ul><p>I hate the negative post…but I don’t want to bullshit you with the markets. This last month of performance wiped out the bullshitters. <strong>I do hope you have a splendid weekend!</strong> Touch some grass, and stick around, like I said, the bull will return in time. As always, if you have questions, feel free to ping me in the chat (linked below) during market hours. I will see you all bright and early Monday morning! Thanks for stopping by 👍</p><p><em>For more visit: <strong><a href=\"https://substack.com/@stocktok?utm_source=user-menu\">StockTok Main Page</a> |</strong> <strong><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/stocktok-summary?r=4z8lgl\">StockTok Positions</a> |</strong></em> <em><strong><a href=\"https://substack.com/chat/3537822\">Chat with Timothy</a> </strong></em></p><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe now&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?\"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p><p><em>Subscribers get direct access with me Monday to Friday during market hours in the chat, stock reviews and access to our StockTok Dashboard, updated daily. <strong><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe\">Subscribe Now.</a></strong></em></p><p>Other Reserources: <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/\">All Publications</a><em><strong> | </strong></em><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/investing-for-beginners-10-short?r=4z8lgl\">Investing For Beginners Series</a> <em><strong>|</strong> </em><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/90-of-traders-fail-and-100-of-them?r=4z8lgl\">Tools Tim Built for TradingView</a> <em><strong>| </strong></em><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/stock-screener-frequently-asked-questions?r=4z8lgl\">Stock Screener FAQ</a> <em><strong>| </strong></em><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/losers-dollar-cost-average-down?r=4z8lgl\">How to DCA UP!</a> </p><div class=\"community-chat\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://open.substack.com/pub/tjstocks/chat?utm_source=chat_embed&quot;,&quot;subdomain&quot;:&quot;tjstocks&quot;,&quot;pub&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:3537822,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Timothy’s StockTok&quot;,&quot;author_name&quot;:&quot;StockTok 📈&quot;,&quot;author_photo_url&quot;:&quot;https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!r3SF!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F545d5c5a-3f40-44b0-b1a1-980901ed236d_565x565.png&quot;}}\" data-component-name=\"CommunityChatRenderPlaceholder\"></div>",
